"Notifications appear while Veteris is not open. Download Notifications tell you when an app was installed, a download finished or failed, or downloads were paused. Background Status also tells you when Veteris keeps working in the background, was restarted after it was closed, and has finished." = "Veteris 未打开时会显示通知。下载通知会告知应用已安装、下载已完成或失败，以及下载已暂停。后台状态也会告知 Veteris 继续在后台运行、关闭后在后台重新启动，以及后台任务已完成。";
"Analytics uses an anonymous install ID to count app requests, searches, and download starts without storing IP addresses. If disabled, request and search analytics stop; download starts may still be counted anonymously without an install ID or device details. Crash reports send technical crash details only when enabled." = "统计功能使用匿名安装 ID 统计应用请求、搜索和下载开始次数，不会保存 IP 地址。关闭后将停止统计请求和搜索。下载开始仍可能以匿名方式统计，不使用安装 ID 或设备信息。只有启用崩溃报告时，才会发送技术崩溃信息。";
